          license, these versioned Terms, or a signed order form controls.
        </p>

        <h2 id="commercial-license">3. Startup commercial license</h2>
        <h3>3.1 License grant</h3>
        <p>
          Subject to payment and continued compliance with this agreement, OpenE2EE grants the
          licensee a limited, non-exclusive, non-transferable (except under Section 10),
