          OBLIGATIONS, A PARTY’S FRAUD OR WILLFUL MISCONDUCT, OR LIABILITY THAT CANNOT LAWFULLY BE
          LIMITED.
        </p>

        <h3>7.3 Customer indemnity</h3>
